    <briefdescription>
<para>Capture a change in pressure for a single pressure set. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>UnitInc may be expressed in terms of upward or downward pressure depending on the client and will be dynamically adjusted for current liveness.</para>
<para>Pressure increments are tiny, typically 1-2 units, and this is only for heuristics, so we don&apos;t check UnitInc overflow. Instead, we may have a higher level assert that pressure is consistent within a region. We also effectively ignore dead defs which don&apos;t affect heuristics much. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
